ined-2small" class="RatingStar__backgroundFill"></use><path class="RatingStar__fill"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4293951705">June 11, 2022</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Rae Lynn was so <i>DUMB</i> and exasperating that I was actually rooting for her to get shot in the head. Like— what the fuck is not clicking, queen? Everything, apparently.<br /><br />Choosing to look the other way and let Jesus take the wheel after you’ve just been <i>explicitly</i> informed that you’re currently being roofied because said drink tastes good and you don’t want to stop drinking it is honestly iconic behavior. I mean, wow.<br /><blockquote>
  <br />
  <i>“Despite the anxiety shooting off alarm bells in my head, I gulped down a mouthful…”<br /><br />“‘You need to stop drinking that, babe.’<br />But the thing was, I didn’t want to stop drinking. Whatever Jeremiah had made me was good…”<br /><br />“…they were good hosts, even if they were secretly plotting to kill me.”</i>
  <br />
</blockquote><br /><br />…she thought that in earnest.<br /><br />I’m—<br />SHE THOUGHT THAT IN EARNEST.<br /><br />They were both clowns. Leon is out here making impassioned monologues, claiming he’ll rip Heaven and Hell and Earth apart before he lets anything happen to Rae Lynn… and then… things… keep repeatedly… happening to her.<br /><br />We got the stupidest human of the bunch and the stupidest demon of the bunch falling in love. Why don’t you both just stop talking. Just let us enjoy y’all looking hot, don’t ruin it by speaking or doing anything. Our fictional Megan Fox and MGK.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">369 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">23 comments</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.709