ext TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted"><b> “I’d fight death as long as I could if it meant giving her more time to run.”</b><br /><br />I CANT LIE AT THE START I THOUGHT I WAS GOING TO HATE THIS BECAUSE I DIDNT READ THE TRIGGER WARNINGS AND AFTER SOME OF YOUR REVIEWS I THOUGHT THIS WAS GOING TO BE A SMUT FEST SO I THOUGHT ID HAVE TO SKIP THE WHOLE BOOK BUT I WAS WRONG THANKS TO MY GORGEOUS BESTIE JENNIE I KNEW WHERE TO SKIP THE PLOT WAS FANTASTIC I LOVED IT IT GAVE MAJOR CONJURING VIBES AND LEON I LOVE YOU 😭😍<br /><br /><b> “Offer me your soul in exchange for protection.”</b><br /><br />Raelynn moves to back to Abelaum a small town where she grew up a small town filled with secrets mystery and murder. Rae craves darkness and films YouTube videos of paranormal occurrences and what better way to get content than to get footage of a creepy church that’s been abandoned for years. Her plans come to a staggering halt when Leon the guard at school the guard she has a slight crush on the guard who’s a prick isn’t who she thinks he is . Leon is a demon summoned from hell who’s speciality is killing now your probably thinking crap she’s fucked it can’t get worse but oh boy it does .Leon tells her that as part of some messed up ritual to wake up a sleeping god she is the next human sacrifice and in-exchange for protection he wants one thing … her SOUL (he could have asked for anything a flipping chocolate bar doesn’t sound too bad but no he asks for her soul💀)<br /><br /><u>Raelynn</u><br /><br /><b>“I was mostly helpless, and maybe I really was just a goddamn liability, but I wasn’t a coward.”</b><br /><br />How can I put this into words I love her and hate her at the same time. Rae was soo funny and sarcastic her comebacks were amazing she didn’t take shit from anyone but she was sooooo dumb like the decisions she made had me wanting to strangle the day lights out of her I GUESS I HATE HER 💀😭 <br /><br /><b>“I’d fucked up. I’d really fucked up. Why did I ever think I could control a demon? Why did I think I could make that work? Some chalk and a Google search didn’t make me a magician — but it sure as hell might make me a corpse.”</b><br /><br />1. Leon tells her to stay inside as there was an Eld (beast) outside what does she do ??? she goes outside with a bat a bat like what part of stay inside do you not get 😭😭<br />2. Leon tells her to stay away from the Hadleigh’s what does she do ?? goes to their party and gets drugged <br />3. Tells her to give him the grimoire well you guessed it she DOESNT GIVE IT and it gets stolen 💀😭😭<br /><br />The list can go onnnn like girl I get it you do what you want we love strong women and hate doormats but please use your brain when a demon tells you it’s not safe then it’s not safe being a doormat would have saved her all the crap she went through. Heyy maybe the author was just trying to portray how humans make stupids mistakes I guess we’ll never know 😭😂😂😂<br /><br /><u>Leon </u><br /><br /><b> “I’ll catch you again, don’t worry. You can’t get away.”</b><br /><br />HE LOVES CATS HE LOVES CATS 😫🥹<br /><br />Leon has my heart how can a demon be soo fricking cute FULLY OBSESSED. He is the perfect amount of protective possessive and sarcastic.His vulnerability and how he was scared of falling in love was adorable the way that the only thing he wanted was freedom broke meeee. He was soo funny that it hurt every word that came out of his mouth had me choking on air😭😂😂<br /><br /><b>“WHAT THE FUCK, RAELYNN!”<br />“I wasn’t going to kill her.<br />I wasn’t going to kill her, goddamn it.<br />But, oh, I was going to make her fucking regret this.”</b><br /><br />My favourite part had to be the part where Rae binded Leon to a binding circle like don’t get me wrong it broke my heart but the adrenaline that i got from that one scene will last me a life time my heart rate was through the roof I was soo scared for her because he lost his shit and 