d her. That I’d die for her.” </b><br /><br />My heart broke when Leon was beaten by a reaper and all he cared about was Rae’s safety. He was dying and despite the fact that he couldn’t speak or move when he saw Jeremiah he managed to push up off the ground and tried to fight him like get this man a medal <br /><br /><b>“My soul is yours to take, Leon,” I whispered. “If you’re still alive...if you can hear me...it’s yours.”</b><br /><br />Rae why couldn’t you have given your soul at the start you can’t live without Leon and want him stay around to protect you but won’t take the deal he’s offering. I can’t lie the part where she did give her soul to him was everything I can’t believe I’d ever be supporting that but hey it’s fictional MY INNER MUSLIM IS SCREAMING . I’m just happy Leon got what he wanted because I’d totally die for Leon he was PERFECTION <br /><br />Spoilers end here ⚠️⚠️⚠️<br /><br />Thank you to my beautiful love Jennie I couldn’t have imagined reading this with anyone else the way we both cried and laughed and not to forget got frustrated made this read amazing <br /><br />To end on a lighter note here are some of my favourite funny quotes because LEONS HUMOUR IS UNMATCHED : <br /><br /><b> “I’m guessing a video of a demon going viral would piss off Hell’s PR department?”</b><br /><br />“Do something?” He shot me a narrow-eyed glare, and said mockingly, “Oh Leon, do something! Save me, please, oh please! What happened to Be gone, demon? What happened to trying to bash my head in with a crucifix?”<br /><br /><b>“Don’t you fucking dare try to piss them off for a video.”</b><br /><br /><b>“So you really can learn magic from Google,” I muttered</b><br /><br /><b> “Rae made me want to be...nice...to her Only to her. Everyone else could get fucked.”</b><br /><br />ONE LAST THING LEON IF I HEAR YOU CALL RAE BABY GIRL 1 MORE TIME IM GOING TO RIP YOUR THROAT OUT💀🤢</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul