9 9.13158H15.0892L12.477 1.34327C12.4269 1.19375 12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></defs><use clip-path="url(#clip_RatingStar_undefined0small)" href="#path_RatingStar_undefined0small" class="RatingStar__backgroundFill"></use><path class="RatingStar__fill"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6825918088">May 13, 2026</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ — 4/5 🧸✨🩶 <br /><br />At first, I had a bit of trouble getting fully into the story 🫠 The first 30% felt slightly hard to focus on, like I was still adjusting to the pacing and atmosphere. But after that, everything started to click 🙂‍↕️ and it became more engaging in a quiet, steady way. It draws you in gradually, until you realize you’re already invested in what’s happening.<br /><br /><b>Leon </b> is not a typical love interest, and that’s what makes him interesting 🔥 He has a strong presence in every scene, and there’s always a sense that you can’t fully predict him 😌 He seems controlled on the surface, but there’s something deeper underneath that keeps you slightly uncertain about him. His interactions may seem simple, but they carry a lot of weight.<br /><br /><b>Raelynn Lawson </b> feels very real in the way she reacts to everything happening around her, especially in how she often doesn’t prioritize her own safety or make choices that protect her in the way you’d expect 😶 Instead, she reacts emotionally, drawn by curiosity, fear, and confusion, and sometimes moves deeper into situations even when they are clearly risky for her. That makes her feel flawed and human rather than careful or controlled 🥺 Her growth comes from recognizing the weight of what she’s stepping into, even if her choices don’t always reflect self-preservation.<br /><br />In the end, what stands out is the overall experience rather than any single moment ✨ The atmosphere builds steadily and leaves a lingering feeling rather than a strong impact. Not everything is immediately clear or comfortable 😩 but that’s part of what makes it stay with you after finishing it.<br /><br />❀⊹⊱ <b> 𝓟𝓻𝓮-𝓻𝓮𝓪𝓭 </b> ⊹⊱❀<br />⤿ a ritualistic cult, a demon, and me pretending this is a good idea… yeah, I definitely see the problem 🙆🏻‍♀️👀</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/172590223?shelf=4-stars-read" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">4-stars-read</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/172590223?shelf=age-gap" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">age-gap</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/172590223?shelf=dark-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">dark-romance</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="st