  <b>Demon dog things are chasing me and my demon guard says to stay inside? </b>
</i> Well, I have a baseball bat so I should be fine. <br><br><i>
  <b> The only supernatural being telling me to stay away from this killer cult that wants to sacrifice me to a God? </b>
</i> Well, the daughter invited me to brunch and gave me cupcakes so they can't be all bad.<br><br><i>
  <b> BINDING THE ONLY DEMON THAT'S SUPPOSED TO PROTECT YOU FROM THE THING IN THE WOODS OUTSIDE OF YOUR HOUSE TO THE COUCH DEFINITELY INSIDE OF YOUR HOUSE? </b>
</i> That's okay. He's a nice demon who obviously has the hots for me so blackmailing him into the circle will be fine.<br><br><img src="https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1640131649ra/32349349.gif" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>I could always count on her to make the wrong decision. It was like a clock that started ticking every time a new problem or situation came up. On that note, it kind of just blew my mind that Leon even still wanted to bone the girl. She's the epitome of dead weight. The summoning circle she created to conjure him in the first place was absolute shit and she did it for a YOUTUBE VIDEO. One of the worst reasons I've ever read to get a demon to come out and play. She's the person in the horror movie that I would want to die first but always ends up surviving until the middle.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">150 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">5 comments</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L1