dy formidable might. In exchange for her very soul, the male main character emerges as her guardian, setting the stage for a dark and compelling narrative.<br /><br />𝙋.𝙨:- 𝙞𝙛 𝙝𝙚 𝙖𝙨𝙠𝙚𝙙 𝙛𝙤𝙧 𝙢𝙞𝙣𝙚 𝙞 𝙬𝙤𝙪𝙡𝙙 𝙜𝙡𝙖𝙙 𝙜𝙞𝙫𝙚 𝙞𝙩 𝙩𝙤 𝙝𝙞𝙢 𝙬𝙞𝙩𝙝𝙤𝙪𝙩 𝙖 𝙨𝙚𝙘𝙤𝙣𝙙 𝙩𝙝𝙤𝙪𝙜𝙝𝙩 🫠🫠<br /><br />➳ 𝙍𝙖𝙚𝙡𝙮𝙣𝙣 𝙇𝙖𝙬𝙨𝙤𝙣<br /><br />Although i found her quite annoying at some of times m̶o̶s̶t̶ o̶f̶ t̶i̶m̶e̶s̶ but she was kind of badass and bold even but idk why she kept getting into trouble and making things worse than it already was. She was funny and witty at times but also an idiot for creating irrelevant chaos.<br /><br />I loved how she never took anyone's shit but honestly when a demon who loves you so bad tells you to go inside and buckle up and stay safe bitch you don't go out with the bat thinking you'd save yourself from a fucking beast with just a baseball bat. i mean what do you think you are; you're literally a mortal who can get crushed in a single second and yet decide to keep this bravado. I know some people would find this badass but i found it pretty reckless. I felt she needed a little more of a character development.<br /><br /><br />➳ 𝙇𝙚𝙤𝙣<br /><br />This blonde, drop-dead sexy, and unapologetically grumpy demon? My heart's been swiped, and he's the culprit. He's the poster child for perfection - you name it, he's got it!! <br /><br />➳ 𝙋𝙧𝙤𝙩𝙚𝙘𝙩𝙞𝙫𝙚?? Oh he is sooo protective of rae like my man literally was ready to lose a limb for his girl and did everything and anything he could to save her.<br /><br />➳ 𝙊𝙗𝙨𝙚𝙨𝙨𝙚𝙙?? He was soo downright obsessed with her that he used to stand outside her door so she could sleep sound and safe. Is that enough nooo??<br /><br />➳ 𝙇𝙤𝙫𝙚𝙨 𝙘𝙖𝙩𝙨?? I mean what do you want more he's such a green flag ik ik he's demon who's really hot but can you imagine a demon loving a cat. Like he legit fought an eld so he could save rae's cat because she loved it. <br /><br />I loved everything about this man but the thing loved the most was his filthy mouth omgg the nasty things he said had me fanning myself. Like in that graveyard scene i legit had to keep my book down and internally scream.<br /><br />❞𝙄’𝙢 𝙜𝙤𝙞𝙣𝙜 𝙩𝙤 𝙬𝙝𝙞𝙥 𝙮𝙤𝙪, 𝙍𝙖𝙚, 𝙪𝙣𝙩𝙞𝙡 𝙮𝙤𝙪𝙧 𝙖𝙨𝙨 𝙞𝙨 𝙧𝙚𝙙 𝙖𝙣𝙙 𝙮𝙤𝙪’𝙧𝙚 𝙗𝙚𝙜𝙜𝙞𝙣𝙜 𝙢𝙚 𝙩𝙤 𝙨𝙩𝙤𝙥. 𝙏𝙝𝙚𝙣 𝙄’𝙢 𝙜𝙤𝙞𝙣𝙜 𝙩𝙤 𝙥𝙪𝙩 𝙮𝙤𝙪 𝙙𝙤𝙬𝙣 𝙤𝙣 𝙮𝙤𝙪𝙧 𝙠𝙣𝙚𝙚𝙨, 𝙖𝙣𝙙 𝙮𝙤𝙪’𝙧𝙚 𝙜𝙤𝙞𝙣𝙜 𝙩𝙤 𝙜𝙖𝙜 𝙤𝙣 𝙢𝙮 𝙘𝙤𝙘𝙠 𝙪𝙣𝙩𝙞𝙡 𝙮𝙤𝙪 𝙥𝙧𝙤𝙫𝙚 𝙟𝙪𝙨𝙩 𝙝𝙤𝙬 𝙨𝙤𝙧𝙧𝙮 𝙮𝙤𝙪 𝙖𝙧𝙚.❞<br /><br />Overall if you're seeking a book that will undoubtedly keep you awake at night, leaving you utterly captivated by a charismatic demon whose provocative charm knows no bounds, then this is an absolute must-read.<br /><br />➸ 𝙌𝙪𝙤𝙩𝙚𝙨 𝙞 𝙡𝙤𝙫𝙚𝙙 :-<br /><br />: ̗̀➛ ❞𝘿𝙤𝙣’𝙩 𝙮𝙤𝙪 𝙛𝙪𝙘𝙠𝙞𝙣𝙜 𝙙𝙤𝙪𝙗𝙩 𝙩𝙝𝙖𝙩 𝙄’𝙡𝙡 𝙝𝙖𝙫𝙚 𝙮𝙤𝙪𝙧 𝙨𝙤𝙪𝙡. 𝙄’𝙢 𝙣𝙤𝙩 𝙡𝙚𝙩𝙩𝙞𝙣𝙜 𝙮𝙤𝙪 𝙜𝙚𝙩 𝙖𝙬𝙖𝙮. 𝙄’𝙢 𝙣𝙤𝙩 𝙡𝙚𝙩𝙩𝙞𝙣𝙜 𝙖𝙣𝙮𝙩𝙝𝙞𝙣𝙜 𝙩𝙖𝙠𝙚 𝙮𝙤𝙪 𝙛𝙧𝙤𝙢 𝙢𝙚. 𝙄’𝙡𝙡 𝙧𝙞𝙥 𝙃𝙚𝙖𝙫𝙚𝙣 𝙖𝙣𝙙 𝙃𝙚𝙡𝙡 𝙖𝙣𝙙 𝙩𝙝𝙞𝙨 𝙜𝙤𝙙𝙙𝙖𝙢𝙣 𝙀𝙖𝙧𝙩𝙝 𝙖𝙥𝙖𝙧𝙩 𝙗𝙚𝙛𝙤𝙧𝙚 𝙄 𝙡𝙚𝙩 𝙩𝙝𝙚𝙢 𝙨𝙩𝙚𝙖𝙡 𝙮𝙤𝙪 𝙛𝙧𝙤𝙢 𝙢𝙚.❞<br /><br />: ̗̀➛ ❞𝙔𝙤𝙪 𝙩𝙝𝙞𝙣𝙠 𝙄 𝙬𝙤𝙣’𝙩 𝙘𝙤𝙣𝙨𝙪𝙢𝙚 𝙚𝙫𝙚𝙧𝙮 𝙡𝙖𝙨𝙩 𝙗𝙞𝙩 𝙤𝙛 𝙮𝙤𝙪??❞ <br />❞𝙄’𝙡𝙡 𝙛𝙪𝙘𝙠𝙞𝙣𝙜 𝙚𝙖𝙩 𝙮𝙤𝙪 𝙖𝙡𝙞𝙫𝙚, 𝙍𝙖𝙚𝙡𝙮𝙣𝙣.❞<br /><br /><br />: ̗̀➛ ❞𝙔𝙤𝙪’𝙧𝙚 𝙖 𝙡𝙞𝙜𝙝𝙩 𝙞𝙣 𝙩𝙝𝙚 𝙙𝙖𝙧𝙠, 𝙖𝙣𝙙 𝙄’𝙫𝙚 𝙗𝙚𝙚𝙣 𝙞𝙣 𝙩𝙝𝙚 𝙙𝙖𝙧𝙠 𝙖 𝙫𝙚𝙧𝙮 𝙡𝙤𝙣𝙜 𝙩𝙞𝙢𝙚.❞<br /><br /><br />: ̗̀➛ ❞𝙄’𝙙 𝙜𝙡𝙖𝙙𝙡𝙮 𝙖𝙙𝙢𝙞𝙩 𝙄 𝙬𝙖𝙨 𝙜𝙚𝙣𝙚𝙧𝙖𝙡𝙡𝙮 𝙖 𝙙𝙞𝙘𝙠, 𝙗𝙪𝙩 𝙍𝙖𝙚 𝙢𝙖𝙙𝙚 𝙢𝙚 𝙬𝙖𝙣𝙩 𝙩𝙤 𝙗𝙚...𝙣𝙞𝙘𝙚...𝙩𝙤 𝙝𝙚𝙧. 𝙊𝙣𝙡𝙮 𝙩𝙤 𝙝𝙚𝙧. 𝙀𝙫𝙚𝙧𝙮𝙤𝙣𝙚 𝙚𝙡𝙨𝙚 𝙘𝙤𝙪𝙡𝙙 𝙜𝙚𝙩 𝙛𝙪𝙘𝙠𝙚𝙙.❞</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">117 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">51 comments</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Rev