er/horror romance, this is a great read! Very unexpected but I loved the gothic vibes, the intensity, and of course the STEAM. It gets kinky here so make sure to check the CWs in the blurb. We’ve got a demon who’s supposed to kill the heroine, but finds that he can’t do it. He chooses to help her and keep her safe instead, all the while making all her dark, twisted sexual fantasies come to life. He’s got some anatomy that made for an interesting read 👀 I liked the heroine too, though I wish she was able to do more when it came to protecting herself. Still, this book is an incredibly entertaining read and I’m hoping the other two books in the series will be about the teased couples!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9303686?shelf=dark-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">dark-romance</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9303686?shelf=dual-multi-pov" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">dual-multi-pov</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9303686?shelf=erotic-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">erotic-romance</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">82 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--i