:{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"to-read","displayName":"Want to Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_wtr","sortOrder":0,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/155301927?shelf=to-read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5784054735"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Pgo7xw0BTEyV_wKQX2jR4Q":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Pgo7xw0BTEyV_wKQX2jR4Q","creator":{"__ref":"User:155301927"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1773601837552,"createdAt":1693720445727,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1694909798273,"text":"\u003cb\u003e “I’d fight death as long as I could if it meant giving her more time to run.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI CANT LIE AT THE START I THOUGHT I WAS GOING TO HATE THIS BECAUSE I DIDNT READ THE TRIGGER WARNINGS AND AFTER SOME OF YOUR REVIEWS I THOUGHT THIS WAS GOING TO BE A SMUT FEST SO I THOUGHT ID HAVE TO SKIP THE WHOLE BOOK BUT I WAS WRONG THANKS TO MY GORGEOUS BESTIE JENNIE I KNEW WHERE TO SKIP THE PLOT WAS FANTASTIC I LOVED IT IT GAVE MAJOR CONJURING VIBES AND LEON I LOVE YOU 😭😍\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e “Offer me your soul in exchange for protection.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRaelynn moves to back to Abelaum a small town where she grew up a small town filled with secrets mystery and murder. Rae craves darkness and films YouTube videos of paranormal occurrences and what better way to get content than to get footage of a creepy church that’s been abandoned for years. Her plans come to a staggering halt when Leon the guard at school the guard she has a slight crush on the guard who’s a prick isn’t who she thinks he is . Leon is a demon summoned from hell who’s speciality is killing now your probably thinking crap she’s fucked it can’t get worse but oh boy it does .Leon tells her that as part of some messed up ritual to wake up a sleeping god she is the next human sacrifice and in-exchange for protection he wants one thing … her SOUL (he could have asked for anything a flipping chocolate bar doesn’t sound too bad but no he asks for her soul💀)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cu\u003eRaelynn\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“I was mostly helpless, and maybe I really was just a goddamn liability, but I wasn’t a coward.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHow can I put this into words I love her and hate her at the same time. Rae was soo funny and sarcastic her comebacks were amazing she didn’t take shit from anyone but she was sooooo dumb like the decisions she made had me wanting to strangle the day lights out of her I GUESS I HATE HER 💀😭 \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“I’d fucked up. I’d really fucked up. Why did I ever think I could control a demon? Why did I think I could make that work? Some chalk and a Google search didn’t make me a magician — but it sure as hell might make me a corpse.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e1. Leon tells her to stay inside as there was an Eld (beast) outside what does she do ??? she goes outside with a bat a bat like what part of stay inside do you not get 😭😭\u003cbr /\u003e2. Leon tells her to stay away from the Hadleigh’s what does she do ?? goes to their party and gets drugged \u003cbr /\u003e3. Tells her to give him the grimoire well you guessed it she DOESNT GIVE IT and it gets stolen 💀😭😭\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe list can go onnnn like girl I get it you do what you want we love strong women and hate doormats but please use your brain when a demon tells you it’s not safe then it’s not safe being a doormat would have saved her all the crap she went through. Heyy maybe the author was just trying to portray how humans make stupids mistakes I guess we’ll never know 😭😂😂😂\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cu\u003eLeon \u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e “I’ll catch you again, don’t worry. You can’t get away.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHE LOVES CATS HE LOVES CATS 😫🥹\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLeon has my heart how can a demon be soo fricking cute FULLY OBSESSED. He is the perfect amount of protective possessive and sarcastic.His vulnerability and how he was scared of falling in love was adorable the way that the only thing he wanted was freedom broke meeee. He was soo funny that it hurt every word that came out of his mouth had me choking on air😭😂😂\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“WHAT THE FUCK, RAELYNN!”\u003cbr /\u003e“I wasn’t going to kill her.\u003cbr /\u003eI wasn’t going to kill her, goddamn it.\u003cbr /\u003eBut, oh, I was going to make her fucking regret this.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMy favourite part had to be the part where Rae binded Leon to a binding circle like don’t get me wrong it broke my heart but the adrenaline that i got from that one scene will last me a life time my heart rate was through the roof I was soo scared for her because he lost his shit and rightfully soo because the one thing Leon hated was not having freedom and he trusted Rae and he was literally injured because of her so he let his guard down and thought it was safe for him to stay over at Rae’s only to be betrayed by someone who he’d sacrifice everything for \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“Callum growled at my suggestion, an angry dog worried over his bone. It was a silly thing to suggest anyway: Everly had clearly already given him her soul. Souls weren’t able to be offered in parcels, it was all or nothing.\u003cbr /\u003eEverly wrapped her hand around his arm, and his growling stopped.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eErm how cute are Everly and Callum I need their book come on a witch and an arch-demon POWER COUPLE. The way callum was already possessive and protective over Everly tells me I’m going to LOVE THEIR BOOK but the growling erm … he’s a demon so maybe that’s why he’s doing that 😭💀\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSpoilers ahead ⚠️⚠️⚠️\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“ It had been love.\u003cbr /\u003eLove when he came back to be sure my house was protected.\u003cbr /\u003eLove when he watched me as a silent guard.\u003cbr /\u003eLove when he turned over his freedom, his name, to me.\u003cbr /\u003eLove when he disappeared into the dark, even though he was afraid, even though he didn’t think he would come back.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe fact that Leon stayed with Rae and protected her even after he found the grimour bearing in mind She hadnt taken the deal of giving her soul meant everything. Taking her soul for Leon was important because demons possessed and he wanted Rae to stay immortal with him forever. The fact that he stayed showed how much affection he had towards Rae as he hated earth because of all the torture and captivity he faced due to the hadelighs HOW CAN WE NOT LOVE LEON \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“I knew.\u003cbr /\u003eI should have said a better good-bye. I’d wanted to fight longer for her.\u003cbr /\u003eBut at least I’d told her. At least I’d admitted the thing that scared me most. The Reaper didn’t seem half as frightening in comparison to my last confession: that I loved her. That I’d die for her.” \u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMy heart broke when Leon was beaten by a reaper and all he cared about was Rae’s safety. He was dying and despite the fact that he couldn’t speak or move when he saw Jeremiah he managed to push up off the ground and tried to fight him like get this man a medal \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“My soul is yours to take, Leon,” I whispered. “If you’re still alive...if you can hear me...it’s yours.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRae why couldn’t you have given your soul at the start you can’t live without Leon and want him stay around to protect you but won’t take the deal he’s offering. I can’t lie the part where she did give her soul to him was everything I can’t believe I’d ever be supporting that but hey it’s fictional MY INNER MUSLIM IS SCREAMING . I’m just happy Leon got what he wanted because I’d totally die for Leon he was PERFECTION \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSpoilers end here ⚠️⚠️⚠️\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThank you to my beautiful love Jennie I couldn’t have imagined reading this with anyone else the way we both cried and laughed and not to forget got frustrated made this read amazing \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTo end on a lighter note here are some of my favourite funny quotes because LEONS HUMOUR IS UNMATCHED : \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e “I’m guessing a video of a demon going viral would piss off Hell’s PR department?”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“Do something?” He shot me a narrow-eyed glare, and said mockingly, “Oh Leon, do something! Save me, please, oh please! What happened to Be gone, demon? What happened to trying to bash my head in with a crucifix?”\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“Don’t you fucking dare try to piss them off for a video.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e“So you really can learn magic from Google,” I muttered\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e “Rae made me want to be...nice...to her Only to her. Everyone else could get fucked.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eONE LAST THING LEON IF I HEAR YOU CALL RAE BABY GIRL 1 MORE TIME IM GOING TO RIP YOUR THROAT OUT💀🤢","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ITXDOOM3LXZD\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LItgaaLlYi2YsWPn\"}}"},"likeCount":268,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":98},"User:151334777":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":151334777,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1784751040i/151334777._UX200_CR0,33,200,2