and the stakes are incredibly high.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe story follows Rae, who is drawn into a tumultuous relationship that challenges her understanding of love and sacrifice. Laroux’s writing is both lyrical and intense, creating an atmosphere that keeps you on the edge of your seat. The characters are richly developed, with their motivations laid bare in a way that is both unsettling and intriguing.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhat sets this book apart is Laroux's fearless approach to taboo themes. She delves into complex emotions and situations, pushing readers to confront their own perceptions of right and wrong. The pacing is relentless, with twists and turns that ensure you’ll be turning pages long into the night.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHowever, it’s worth noting that the book does contain mature themes that may not be suitable for all readers. Laroux doesn’t shy away from graphic content, which serves to enhance the story's emotional weight but might not appeal to everyone.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOverall, Her Soul to Take is a thought-provoking read that challenges the conventional notions of love and morality. It’s perfect for readers who enjoy dark romance and psychological depth. I highly recommend it to anyone looking to explore the complexities of the human psyche wrapped in a thrilling narrative.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e______________________\u003cbr /\u003eI cannot believe that I convinced myself to read this book. Will pick this up as soon as I'm finished with my current reads. Also, even though I had this book in my tbr for a few years, this was recommended to me not too long ago.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShould I be excited or scared? \u003cb\u003e*DUN DUN DUUUNNNNN*\u003c/b\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2VSCYKLS0O68U\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LItgaaLlYi2YsWPn\"}}"},"likeCount":99,"viewe