"__typename":"Tag","name":"rereads","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/126364621?shelf=rereads"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"online-hbr","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/126364621?shelf=online-hbr"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance-paranormal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/126364621?shelf=romance-paranormal"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"unslumpers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/126364621?shelf=unslumpers"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance-poly-threesome","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/126364621?shelf=romance-poly-threesome"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4264579642"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.es8bAihY4T0buyWuZtC0ew":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.es8bAihY4T0buyWuZtC0ew","creator":{"__ref":"User:126364621"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1785281883579,"createdAt":1633003435524,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1666453794022,"text":"➥ 4.5 Stars *:･ﾟ✧\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eLeon withdrew his fingers, and I leaned back heavily against the wall in the afterglow. I had no words that would suffice for the rush of that experience: the frantic pleasure, the fear of being caught, the disbelief at what I was doing. Without my noticing, Leon had taken my vape from my pocket, and he held it up to my lips as he also held up his slick fingers to the streetlight’s glow. They glistened as I took a slow, light-headed drag from the pen.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“Beautiful,” he said softly. He put one finger into his mouth, and sucked it clean as I exhaled. The smoke swirled around his face as Zane came to his side.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“That was fucking gorgeous,” he said, slinging an arm around Leon’s shoulder and looking me hungrily up and down. Then Leon held up his middle finger, still glistening, and Zane took it slowly into his mouth, licking it clean.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“Always the middle finger,” Zane muttered, straightening his jacket as he licked his lips.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“For you? Always.” Leon stepped away, looking me over as I buttoned my jeans with clumsy fingers. He held out my vape. “Thanks for playing. See you on campus, doll.” He gave me a two-finger salute, and he and Zane left the alley side by side, chuckling as they went.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e━━━━━━━━━━━ ♡ ━━━━━━━━━━━\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt's about time I wrote a review for this one. This was probably the book that really cemented my love for Harley Laroux's books. They're all so intense, hot but also sweet and squeal-worthy. This book is definitely in need of a reread \u0026lt;3\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\u003cb\u003e➥ Rae (h)\u003c/b\u003e was not my favourite fmc that HL has written. Since I'm writing this review after I've read \u003ca href=\"https://goodreads.com/book/show/56635834.The_Dare\" title=\"The Dare by Harley Laroux\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eThe Dare\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://goodreads.com/book/show/58930992.Her_Soul_for_Revenge__Souls_Trilogy___2_\" title=\"Her Soul for Revenge (Souls Trilogy, #2) by Harley Laroux\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eHer Soul for Revenge\u003c/a\u003e, I think Rae is my least favourite. She doesn't have that fun brattiness that Jess does, nor is she as hot and badass as Juniper. She made some silly decisions and wasn't as engaging with Leon as I would have liked her to be. I think it's more fun when both mcs are on very even playing field (like in \u003ca href=\"https://goodreads.com/book/show/58930992.Her_Soul_for_Revenge__Souls_Trilogy___2_\" title=\"Her Soul for Revenge (Souls Trilogy, #2) by Harley Laroux\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eHer Soul for Revenge\u003c/a\u003e). That's the main critique of mine that lowered my rating by 0.5 stars. But other than that, I loved (nearly) \u003ci\u003eeverything else\u003c/i\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e➥ Leon (H)\u003c/b\u003e is so hot woah. He's definitely one of my top book bfs and even tops Zane from the second book. He's so protective but funny and sweet inside. He's just everything. Probably the best example of an \"I hate everyone but you\" man. And although I complained about Rae's damsel complex, I must say, I absolutely \u003ci\u003eloved it\u003c/i\u003e every time he had to save her hehe. The only thing that broke my heart was the use of \"baby girl\". It began around the 75% mark and it killed me because it would have been perfect without it. It's down to personal preference of course, but I can't help but cringe every time I hear it. It's like I can actually hear Massimo saying it 😭 \"bebigorl\".\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e“I’d gladly admit I was generally a dick, but Rae made me want to be...nice...to her. Only to her. Everyone else could get fucked.”\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHonestly, this book exceeded all my expectations. I was never once bored; both the romance, smut, and plot had me very entertained. Leon, as mentioned, is just delectable and a reminder to me that hot men exist. Sometimes dark romance love interests are too cringey to me because they're always yelling and barking which makes me unable to take them seriously, but Leon is all cool and calm, that's how he maintains his power and it's hot af. The sex scenes were so unique and well-written. I really do recommend this for anyone who's looking to get into dark romance. I love how, although this is dark romance, HL still makes it so that the act is always consensual and both characters can always use their safeword.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e“The ache of looking at her was almost too much, the sweetest pain in my chest as I brushed her hair back from her face before turning to leave her. Love. What an odd thing.”\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAs my last little complaint, I'd probably critique that if the characters are separated, we deserve a sex scene when they're back together again. I loved the drama, the stakes, the requiring all of it, but a little bit more steam towards the end would've been nice. Especially something nice and tender since they were in looove then hehe. Maybe in future, I'd like a threesome scene... maybe between Leon, Zane and Rae \u003cb\u003eor\u003c/b\u003e (even better) Juniper, Leon and Rae. There was just so much chemistry in that one moment at the beginning... (the featured quote lolol). Leon could slap me any day, bye.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e━━━━━━━━━━━ ♡ ━━━━━━━━━━━\u003c/blockquote\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AN6NQSQWDEFUS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LItgaaLlYi2YsWPn\"}}"},"likeCount":94,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":28},"User:113008174":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":113008174,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1713516443i/113008174._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":8686,"textReviewsCount":100,"name":"moretomary","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/113008174-moretomary","contributor":null,"id":113008174},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2U4F5FLAVZ6DI":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2U4F5FLAVZ6DI"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2U4F5FLAVZ6DI\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LItgaaLlYi2YsWPn\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2U4F5FLAVZ6DI","id":"k