\u003cbr\u003eOh boy... How I loved to be wrong!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAfter a few ongoings, the book catch up in a fast pace, full of action, sex, suspense, sex, chase, blood, sex and tears. (Did I mentioned sex? Because holy cow... The man can fuck! And I'm not even talking about that tongue 🥵🔥)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI loved how the author build up Leon's personality, and how he was such a grumpy protector of Rae, and girllllll... Rae was a full plate to be carried! \u003cbr\u003eShe was a little annoying at first and the girl couldn't help herself in anyway at all! She was always putting herself in danger and seeking the type of situations that makes you the first death in a horror movie...\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLucky girl to have such a hot and protector demon on her team!\u003cbr\u003eLeon suffered like hell to keep her alive!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI'm kinda of obsessed with all demons in this book, they're truly way better than the humans here... \u003cbr\u003eLeon, Zane and Callum can have my soul and body (specially body 🥵) anytime they want!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI loved the way she finished their story, even if it took forever to Rae grow some balls! 😂😂😂 \u003cbr\u003eI would have melted for Leon at the first \u003cb\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003eAre you fucking lost?\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e 🥵🔥😈\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI cannot wait for my other babies books!\u003cbr\u003eBring it on my Zane and my Callum!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHighly recommend it!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/dreambooksclub/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1599501634i/30075371._SX540_.jpg\" alt=\"Pics-Art-09-06-04-52-19\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\n\u003c/a\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A9FRCX62YNILH\"},\"boo